  • Field_4: Drone_5 and Drone_6 (2 drones; full protection needs 3)
Since Field_2 is the next most critical with a threat level of 0.14 it is best if it is fully protected. To bring Field_2 from 3 to 4 drones we preferentially choose a drone from a lower‐priority field. Comparing the candidates from Field_1 and Field_4 and also checking distances (using Field_2’s centre, approximately (14,37.5)), we found that between the two drones on Field_4, Drone_6 (with a roughly 40-unit distance) is less useful for Field_4 than Drone_5 (which is very near its Field_4 centre). So we reassign Drone_6 from Field_4 to help Field_2.
